# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PATIENT DATA — NEVER COMMIT
#
# The hackathon data belongs to a real, living child and is shared under
# a controlled-access protocol (WCG IRB #20252010). Participants agree to
# delete all data after the hackathon and to notify Sage Bionetworks by
# email. Nothing derived from it that could identify or re-identify the
# individual may be published. These rules are not defaults — they are
# the terms of access — so this file is deliberately aggressive and
# denies by extension rather than by name.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Raw sequence and variant data, by extension
*.fastq
*.fastq.gz
*.fq
*.fq.gz
*.bam
*.bai
*.cram
*.crai
*.vcf
*.vcf.gz
*.vcf.gz.tbi
*.tbi
*.idx
*.fa
*.fasta
*.fa.gz
*.fasta.gz
*.fai
*.2bit

# Any folder the dataset was unpacked into
data/
Dataset/
dataset/
raw/
RESTRICTED*/
restricted*/

# Per-variant genotype tables derived from the patient's genome.
# These are individual-level data even though they are plain text.
mva_rare_coding_variants.tsv
mva_prioritised_candidates.csv
mva_genomewide_secondary_findings.csv
panel_raw.vcf.gz*
panel_variants.tsv
panel_annotated.tsv
candidates.tsv
roh_regions.txt
locus_all_variants.tsv
context_1mb_variants.tsv
patient_variants_avi.tsv
slc34a1_locus.json
aneu_parts.json
loh_bins.json
panel_pgx.json

# Clinical documents
*phenotype*.docx
*Phenotype*.docx
*.docx
~$*

# Credentials. API keys belong in the shell environment, never on disk.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*_api_key*
*token*
.netrc

# Scratch and build noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.venv/
venv/
env/


# Generated test fixture. Rebuilt deterministically by `make validate`
# (fixed seed), so it is regenerated rather than committed. The validation
# OUTPUT is committed, at results/discriminator_validation.txt, so a reviewer
# can see the result without running anything.
tests/synthetic.vcf*
aneu_parts.json
loh_bins.json

# NOT ignored, and intentionally so:
#   mva_panel.GRCh38.*.bed         gene coordinates, public (Ensembl)
#   mva_panel.GRCh38.provenance.tsv  provenance of those coordinates
#   alphagenome_controls.tsv       synthetic control variants, not the patient's
#   Mat34ec_track1_*.csv           the submission itself, 3 rows, required to be public
